{
  "title": "Extracted titles keep a trailing space or newline",
  "description": "Three pipeline snapshots have titles with trailing whitespace: \"Loco Moco (White Rice With Hamburger Patties and Fried Eggs)\\n\" (seriouseats-com_loco-moco-recipe-11735563), \"Reverse-Seared Steak \" (seriouseats-com_reverse-seared-steak-recipe) and \"Bless This Pickle Sandwich \" (food52-com_recipes-85546-pickle-sandwich-recipe). \
A title like that is saved as is, so it sorts, matches and displays slightly wrong. \
A newline also broke the judged ai-eval suites' golden sets, which now trim titles themselves (cli/src/ai_eval/judged.rs). \
Trim the title wherever extraction produces it (ramekin-core/src/extract/), check that the server trims titles on save, then rerun `make pipeline` and commit the snapshot diffs.",
